の創立祭騒ぎも発端は彼女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2614","sourceWorkId":"19809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園を卒業後、ひたすら我が道を行く天才海賊娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すでに地図にない島を発見したり、海底遺跡から宝物をざっくざっく集めてきたりと、活躍が広がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同時に敵も多くなっているが、それすら楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園時代の仲間の前に突然現れては、拉致して冒険に付き合わせる悪癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思い立ったら即座に行動が信条で、今回の創立祭騒ぎも発端は彼女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"142458"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d710912df1d7a1d15e67c2ae20ad213ad63d723787249cd4bde54637388c9c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e31332f4d9233f48c78daf1c2db34af898fada72893013f7395bcb52cadd4e0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:95663:142458:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21864","characterName":"キューテ＝オトカネ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"142459","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"44498"},{"characterId":"142459","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"95663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2615"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21864"},"originalCharacterName":"キューテ＝オトカネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【頼れるお姉さんハーピー】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教員番号：01-01　種族：ハーピー(ハーフ)　誕生日：金剛の月29日"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：高　体重：軽い　友好度：友好"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒビキとルピュアの娘。保険医として学園に勤めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生からの信頼は厚いが、学園長の娘と